# ESP32 Gemini Server in Rust!

Welcome to my ESP32 Gemini server!

This capsule is served by a classic ESP32 running a Gemini protocol server written in Rust with ESP-IDF.

## About this project

- Gemini protocol over TLS
- Rust firmware for the classic ESP32
- LittleFS-based content storage
- Bounded request handling and streaming responses
- Runtime status and boot diagnostics

